(7232,'Views can be enabled or disabled from the <a href=\":list\">Views list page</a>. To enable a view, find the view within the \"Disabled\" list and select the \"Enable\" operation. To disable a view find the view within the \"Enabled\" list and select the \"Disable\" operation.','','none'),
