(10943,'Choose whether new users can set their password directly on the registration form and login during registration (without email confirmation), or if they will be required to validate their email address prior to logging into the site, and will be assigned a system-generated password, or they can set a password during registration, but first have to confirm their account via the activation email sent after registration is complete, before they can log in to the site.','','11.4.10'),
(10944,'Path to redirect the user to after confirming their account','','11.4.10'),
