(11037,'Use tokens to avoid redundant meta data and search engine penalization. For example, a \'keyword\' value of \"example\" will be shown on all content using this configuration, whereas using the [node:field_keywords] automatically inserts the \"keywords\" values from the current entity (node, term, etc).','','11.4.10'),
