(11039,'To use tokens to image fields, the image field on that entity bundle (content type, term, etc) must have the \"Token\" display settings enabled, the image field must not be hidden, and it must be set to output as an image, e.g. using the \"Thumbnail\" field formatter. It is also recommended to use an appropriate image style that resizes the image rather than output the original image; see individual meta tag descriptions for size recommendations.','','11.4.10'),
